.TH PERR 1.SH NAMEperr \- print the text of OS-9 error codes.SH SYNOPSIS\fBperr\fRcode ....SH DESCRIPTIONFor each error code,\fBperr\fRprints its name and the explanation from the system's error message file:.nf    perr 216    Error #000:216 (E$PNNF) That path name doesn't lead to anything....fiA code is written\fIddd\fRor\fIgroup\fR:\fIddd\fR,\fRas OS-9 reports them.  A code the file does not know is shown as\fB<<unknown error code>>\fR.\fR.SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOerror